From: axon7-build <axon7-build@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:56:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/20] input: fingerprint: goodix: track the IRQ as enabled
 after request_threaded_irq (unbalanced enable in gf_open)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FVN6i29oeF8XZDRKkkCQqG
Change-Id: I70f2ef615f52a511ba591c3a34f6ccb90d8a5341
---
 drivers/input/fingerprint/goodix/gf_spi.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/input/fingerprint/goodix/gf_spi.c b/drivers/input/fingerprint/goodix/gf_spi.c
index 438af552f3f0..4a7ebeb0fafe 100755
--- a/drivers/input/fingerprint/goodix/gf_spi.c
+++ b/drivers/input/fingerprint/goodix/gf_spi.c
@@ -678,6 +678,8 @@ static int gf_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 					   "gf", gf_dev);
 		if (!ret) {
 			enable_irq_wake(gf_dev->irq);
+			/* request_threaded_irq() leaves it enabled */
+			gf_dev->irq_enabled = 1;
 			gf_disable_irq(gf_dev);
 		}
 	}
